                                                    "patching_rect": [ 6.0, 67.0, 315.0, 261.0 ],
                                                    "text": "One shot video triggering\nsend in a bang in the first inlet to trigger the video\naudio goes thru computer default output (not thru max)\n\ndrop a video file in the field\n\nyou can click the bang button to trigger if you need to test\n\nstartPos is the normalized position in the video timeline you want to trigger when you send\n\nduration is how long the video should play, in millisecods\nafter that the video will freeze\n\nspeed is the speed of the video playback\n\nvolume is the sound volume\n\n"
